{"4490860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scam Grandpa", "steam_appid": 4490860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scam Grandpa is a visual novel where you convince Grandpa into giving you 10 million dollars. Reach that amount by the end of the story or face severe consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate Grandpa by making him feel loved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490860/extras/fb404e6c4a2329256f5532ce27dc8cb1.poster.avif?t=1775039261\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490860/extras/fb404e6c4a2329256f5532ce27dc8cb1.webm?t=1775039261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490860/extras/fb404e6c4a2329256f5532ce27dc8cb1.mp4?t=1775039261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Grandpa think through his problems. You'll get a few insults but it could be worth it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490860/extras/4eb8d30a21e634f2ef1f65221ee59df5.poster.avif?t=1775039261\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490860/extras/4eb8d30a21e634f2ef1f65221ee59df5.webm?t=1775039261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490860/extras/4eb8d30a21e634f2ef1f65221ee59df5.mp4?t=1775039261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being resourceful is an asset. Help Grandpa get out of sticky situations, and get paid well for it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490860/extras/399f7d38c1af74c54dd684c8fbcf93a2.poster.avif?t=1775039261\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490860/extras/399f7d38c1af74c54dd684c8fbcf93a2.webm?t=1775039261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490860/extras/399f7d38c1af74c54dd684c8fbcf93a2.mp4?t=1775039261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grandpa may not be the luckiest when it comes to women.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490860/extras/5d0852e39349f93bd96943623f54d2f1.poster.avif?t=1775039261\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490860/extras/5d0852e39349f93bd96943623f54d2f1.webm?t=1775039261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490860/extras/5d0852e39349f93bd96943623f54d2f1.mp4?t=1775039261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may need a travel visa to Greenland but it's unclear why. It would also be a good opportunity to pitch Grandpa of your fake immigration services earn a couple million dollars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490860/extras/287983c7cc603fac88de6ae27cb8d5e9.poster.avif?t=1775039261\